s.html#Lean.Meta.SimpLemmaNames\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">SimpLemmaNames</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_extends\">extends</span> <span id=\"Lean.Meta.SimpLemmaNames.toDeclKeyedMap\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/DeclKeyedMap.html#Lean.DeclKeyedMap\">Lean.DeclKeyedMap</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.html#Lean.Meta.Origin\">Lean.Meta.Origin</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The origins of the theorems in a simp set (`SimpTheorems.lemmaNames`). Imported origins are\nrepresented as an `ImportedDeclKeyedMap`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.html#Lean.Meta.SimpLemmaNames","kind":"structure","line":650,"name":"Lean.Meta.SimpLemmaNames","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.lean#L650-L655"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.html#Lean.Meta.instKeyOrigin\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">instKeyOrigin</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/DeclKeyedMap.html#Lean.ImportedDeclKeyedMap.Key\">ImportedDeclKeyedMap.Key</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.html#Lean.Meta.Origin\">Origin</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.html#Lean.Meta.instKeyOrigin","kind":"instance","line":646,"name":"Lean.Meta.instKeyOrigin","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.lean#L646-L648"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.html#Lean.Meta.Origin.quickLt\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Origin</span>.<span class=\"name\">quickLt</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.html#Lean.Meta.Origin\">Origin</a> → <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.html#Lean.Meta.Origin\">Origin</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Compares origins by name hash, for binary search.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.html#Lean.Meta.Origin.quickLt","kind":"def","line":639,"name":"Lean.Meta.Origin.quickLt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.lean#L639-L644"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.html#Lean.Meta.SimpTheoremTree\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">SimpTheoremTree</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.html#Lean.Meta.SimpTheoremTree","kind":"def","line":637,"name":"Lean.Meta.SimpTheoremTree","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.lean#L637-L637"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.html#Lean.Meta.mkSimpEntryOfDeclToUnfold\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkSimpEntryOfDeclToUnfold</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">declName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.html#Lean.Meta.SimpEntry\">SimpEntry</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Given the name of a declaration to unfold, return the `SimpEntry` (or entries) that\nimplement this unfolding, using either the equational theorems, or `SimpEntry.toUnfold`, or both.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.html#Lean.Meta.mkSimpEntryOfDeclToUnfold","kind":"def","line":598,"name":"Lean.Meta.mkSimpEntryOfDeclToUnfold","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.lean#L598-L634"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.html#Lean.Meta.Simp.unfoldEvenWithEqns\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Simp</span>.<span class=\"name\">unfoldEvenWithEqns</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">declName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/CoreM.html#Lean.Core.CoreM\">CoreM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Even if a function has equation theorems,\nwe also store it in the `toUnfold` set in the following two cases:\n1- It was defined by structural recursion and has a smart-unfolding associated declaration.\n2- It is non-recursive.\n\nReason: `unfoldPartialApp := true` or conditional equations may not apply.\n\nRemark: In the future, we are planning to disable this\nbehavior unless `unfoldPartialApp := true`.\nMoreover, users will have to use `f.eq_def` if they want to force the definition to be\nunfolded.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.html#Lean.Meta.Simp.unfoldEvenWithEqns","kind":"def","line":580,"name":"Lean.Meta.Simp.unfoldEvenWithEqns","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.lean#L580-L596"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.html#Lean.Meta.Simp.ignoreEquations\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Simp</span>.<span class=\"name\">ignoreEquations</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">declName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/CoreM.html#Lean.Core.CoreM\">CoreM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Reducible functions and projection functions should always be put in `toUnfold`, instead\nof trying to use equational theorems.\n\nThe simplifiers has special support for structure and class projections, and gets\nconfused when they suddenly rewrite, so ignore equations for them","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.html#Lean.Meta.Simp.ignoreEquations","kind":"def","line":570,"name":"Lean.Meta.Simp.ignoreEquations","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/SimpTheorems.lean#L570-L578"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"de